# Facilitate Studio - Cursor AI Rules

This project is a 3D simulation editor built with React, TypeScript, and Three.js via React Three Fiber.

---

## Project Overview

**Facilitate Studio** is a desktop-first web application for creating interactive 3D simulations and tutorials. Users can:
- Import 3D models (GLB, GLTF, FBX, OBJ)
- Arrange objects in a scene
- Create simulation steps (info cards, move-item animations)
- Preview simulations with camera animations
- Save/load projects with IndexedDB persistence

---

