## File Organization

```
src/
├── components/           # React components
│   ├── scene/           # Three.js scene components
│   └── preview/         # Preview mode components
├── contexts/            # React contexts (PopupContext)
├── hooks/               # Custom hooks
│   └── undoRedo/        # Undo/redo system
├── pages/               # Route-level pages
├── persistence/         # IndexedDB operations
├── types/               # TypeScript types
├── utils/               # Utility functions
└── test/                # Test setup
```

### Naming Conventions
- Components: `PascalCase.tsx` (e.g., `MainCanvas.tsx`)
- Hooks: `useCamelCase.ts` (e.g., `useModelUpload.ts`)
- Utils: `camelCase.ts` (e.g., `focusUtils.ts`)
- Tests: `*.test.ts` or `*.test.tsx`
- Types: `camelCase.ts` for modules (e.g., `project.ts`)

